===Meet up with an old friend at the Administrative District Plaza{{subst:void|<!--201190101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=Administrative District|With curiosity and excitement, you step into Belobog's domain once again.<br />Perhaps some wondrous adventure would happen this time as well? Who knows...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Pela)
:'''Pela:''' Hey, it's you, (Trailblazer)! I didn't expect to see you here in the Administrative District. How have you been lately?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Pretty good. How about you?
::'''Pela:''' Great to hear! Since the Stellaron crisis subsided, Belobog's been feeling a little more cheerful. We're really grateful for your assistance...
::'''Pela:''' ...and yes, things are going well for me too &mdash; thanks for asking!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Things could be better.
::'''Pela:''' Oh... Don't worry, things will get better &mdash; I'm sure of it.
::'''Pela:''' Speaking of things getting better, Belobog's been feeling a little more cheerful since the Stellaron crisis subsided. We couldn't have done it without you.
:'''Pela:''' You spent so much time in Belobog on your last visit &mdash; you must have passed by here before, right?
:'''Pela:''' This is Belobog's History and Culture Museum &mdash; built more than six hundred years ago.
:'''Pela:''' Last time you visited, it was closed for its ten-year renovation.
:'''Pela:''' Now that the Stellaron crisis is over, we've been able to allocate more manpower to the renovation works. The museum should be open to the public again soon.
:'''Pela:''' It's just...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Just what?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...You ran into trouble?
:'''Pela:''' ...We encountered a problem during the renovation process. The Silvermane Guards are doing all they can to figure it out.
:'''Pela:''' I... *sigh* Sorry, (Trailblazer), I shouldn't talk about it in the open like this. Hey – why don't I give you a tour of the museum? We can talk inside while I show you around...
:'''Pela:''' ...if you have time, that is.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That sounds nice.
:'''Pela:''' Great! What are we waiting for?
----
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Follow Pela{{subst:void|<!--201190104-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=adventure|location=History and Culture Museum|update|Pela mentioned that the Belobog History and Culture Museum, currently being renovated, is facing some problems.<br />Visit the museum with her to understand the issues at hand.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Pela:''' Past the Reception Hall, you'll find the General Hall &mdash; the museum's largest exhibition room.
:'''Pela:''' There are all sorts of exhibits on display – paintings by famous artists, samples of the planet's crust... Visitors can experience the essence of Belobog's culture in just a few minutes' time.
:'''Pela:''' I really hope the museum can open up soon... The children here need a culturally-enriching environment &mdash; especially those from the Underworld...
:'''Pela:''' ...but like I mentioned earlier, we're in a bit of a bind &mdash; we could really use a helping hand.

;(По прибытии на место)
<pre>{
	"$type": "RPG.GameCore.ClearNpcDistanceTrigger",
	"GroupID": 9,
	"GroupNpcID": 400002
}</pre>
----
:'''Pela:''' Here – this is the issue we're trying to deal with.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The exhibit disappeared?
::'''Pela:''' It was stolen.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} There's a thief on the prowl?
::'''Pela:''' ...Wow, you're quick! Yes, this exhibit was stolen just recently.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So you need help opening this cabinet...
::'''Pela:''' Wait! What are you doing!?
::'''Pela:''' *sigh* You're in a museum, remember!? Here, let me explain – this exhibit was recently stolen.
:'''Pela:''' It was one of the oldest and most precious items in the General Hall collection &mdash; the {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|Meteor Fragment}}.
:'''Pela:''' It is said that seven hundred years ago, the invaders from beyond the sky descended upon the surface of Jarilo-VI with a meteor shower. The Meteor Fragment is solid evidence that those invaders once tainted our land...
:'''Pela:''' ...Ahem, sorry, the tour guide in me gets a little carried away &mdash; I'm not here to give you a history lesson. Still, it's no exaggeration to say that if the Meteor Fragment isn't recovered, the museum will lose half of its significance.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Do you know who the thief is?
::'''Pela:''' ...Not yet. That's why this case is such a conundrum for the Silvermane Guards.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can't we just use a replica?
::'''Pela:''' ...Out of the question! As the curator of the exhibits here, I would never resort to deceiving the public like that...
::'''Pela:''' Our first priority is finding the thief and recovering the stolen item, but we don't even have a suspect yet... That's why this case is such a conundrum for the Silvermane Guards.
:'''Pela:''' Truth be told, the Meteor Fragment isn't the only item that was stolen... but we want the museum to open as soon as possible. We can worry about the other missing items later.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Any leads?
::'''Pela:''' Of course &mdash; I wouldn't ask you to start a whole investigation from scratch.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I think I know who the culprit is.
::'''Pela:''' Ah, you must be thinking of Sampo, right? I don't think so, our people have been keeping a close eye on him these days. The reports say he's been on his best behavior – not the slightest hint of trouble-making.
:'''Pela:''' The guards stationed in the Underworld reported that some suspicious characters have been meeting at {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|a hideout in the Great Mine}} late at night.
:'''Pela:''' Since the Silvermane Guards are still getting situated in the Underworld and we don't have any direct evidence, we haven't been able to apprehend any suspects.
:'''Pela:''' But if you were to go there yourself and ask around... I think we could gather a lot of useful intel.
:'''Pela:''' So, (Trailblazer), would you like to help solve this case?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'd love to.
::'''Pela:''' Excellent! Just as I expected &mdash; short, sweet, and decisive. To the Underworld it is, then.
